---
// The page in his own voice, before any of the work: who he is and what he is into.
---

<section id="about" class="wrap about" aria-labelledby="about-h" data-section="About" data-ground>
  <header class="about-h" data-reveal="title">
    <h2 id="about-h">About</h2>
    <p class="idx readout" aria-hidden="true">01 / 05</p>
  </header>
  <div class="say" data-reveal="prose">
    <p class="first">
      I'm Jerry. I'm from Toronto, and I study computer science at the University of Waterloo as a
      Schulich Leader.
    </p>
    <p>
      Space is the thing I find coolest: Dyson swarms, asteroid mining, and science fiction that takes
      its physics seriously, like the Xeelee Sequence. The cover of this page is that interest with
      the arithmetic done.
    </p>
    <p>
      I also love AI agents, simulation, and making things people use. Most days I'm building
      alongside coding agents.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Like every part of the page, it keeps to the left and leaves the right to the sky. */
  .about {
    display: grid;
    row-gap: 22px;
    padding-top: clamp(72px, 9vw, 136px);
  }
  .about > * {
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .about-h {
    display: grid;
    row-gap: 14px;
  }
  .about-h .idx {
    order: -1;
    margin-bottom: -2px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.038em;
  }
  .say {
    max-width: 40em;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.008em;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .say p + p {
    margin-top: 0.85em;
  }
  .first {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .say a {
    padding-block: 6px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .say {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }
</style>
